Package: optLump
Title: Tools for Lumping Categorical Covariates in a Way That Preserves Information
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daan Olivier", "Koning", , "daanolivierkoning@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Takes a categorical covariate and lumps (combines) multiple of the levels together. The way it chooses to do this is by optimizing for the preservation of mutual information between the pre- and post-lumping variables. Support exists for both ordinal, hierarchical, and fully nominal variables.
